    "title": "Mirror App - Check your makeup",
    "description": "This is the Hand Mirror App for your beauty. You can easily check your makeup and skin condition in various situations at home or on the go.\r\n\r\nPlease use the free Hand Mirror App for applying makeup at home or on the go.\r\n\r\nHand Mirror App also supports take and share photos, so you can take snapshots of your daily life and share them on SNS.\r\n\r\n<b>Hand Mirror App Use Cases</b>\r\n\u30fb Makeup at home\r\n\u30fb Makeup on the go\r\n\u30fb Take a selfie\r\n\u30fb Share photos on SNS\r\n\r\n<b>Hand Mirror App Permission</b>\r\nThe following two permission is required to use the app. We never use these permissions for any purpose other than those stated. So please use it at ease.\r\n\r\n\u30fb Camera - Display images on your phone\r\n\u30fb Storage - Save images on your phone\r\n\r\n<b>Hand Mirror App Security</b>\r\nThe app is released after checking security with 6 antivirus software from different vendors for each update.\r\n\r\nPlease enjoy Hand Mirror App in various situations.",
